# Private pilot data. Anything dropped straight into raw/ or processed/
# stays ignored, so an inverter log is not committed by mistake.
# The weather downloads, live forecasts and simulated PV tables are tracked
# so the team can clone them. data/sample/ is tracked too.
data/raw/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep
!data/raw/weather/
!data/raw/live/
data/processed/*
!data/processed/.gitkeep
!data/processed/pv_simulated/
